    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Verifies the valid value ranges that {@link PaxChronology} reports for its supported date fields. <p>The Pax calendar normally has 13 months of 28 days, but every leap year inserts a 14th month (\"Pax\") of 7 days. This makes several field ranges vary between a common year and a leap year, which is why the expected ranges below use the {@code (min, largestMin, max)} or {@code (min, smallestMax, max)} forms rather than a simple {@code (min, max)}."
   },
   {
    "id": "i2",
